WEBVTT

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.420
﻿Pocket Monsters, or Pokémon for short.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.750
﻿The strange, strange creatures of this planet.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.750
In the Sky...

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:16.750
In the Oceans...

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.200
On the land...

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.200
In the cities...

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.680
﻿All over the world, you'll be able to see them.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.200
Some live alongside humans, others on their own in the wild.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Some form herds together with their kin. They live in all sorts of ways.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.210
﻿This boy is Satoshi of Masara Town. ﻿

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.800
﻿Alongside his partner Pikachu, he is baffling and getting Pokémon.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.350
﻿He's continuing his journey as a Pokemon Trainer
﻿aiming to learn new things along the way.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.560
﻿There are as many meetings as there are Pokémon.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:09.110
﻿There are as many dreams as there are Pokémon.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:13.530
﻿There await as many adventures as there are Pokémon.

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:40.180
﻿There you are

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:51.100
Keldeo, you've done well to notice my presence.

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.440
﻿I listened to the voice of the grass.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Very good.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.700
﻿Even the grass gets along with me.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.280
﻿Virizion, I challenge you!

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:01.990
If you ﻿can keep up with me, sure.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.320
﻿Against a sword, I'll use another sword!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.080
﻿What's the matter?

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.960
﻿This horn will be my sword!

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:14.440
﻿Terrakion, fight me!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:19.190
﻿At it again!

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:23.240
﻿I have no plans to quit!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.280
w﻿e'll begin with this!

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.250
﻿Come on, get serious!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.080
﻿Getting cheeky, huh?

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.330
﻿Still want to go at it?

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:16.920
﻿Of course!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.430
﻿Cobalon, I challenge you!

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.140
﻿The storm will get even worse!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.500
It doesn't matter!

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:02.920
﻿You're being reckless.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.250
No, I'm not!

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.550
I won't lose to anyone anymore!

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.460
﻿When will you let me fight against Kyurem?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.000
﻿I want to be a Sacred Swordsman!

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.000
Please let me fight Kyurem!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.900
What do you think of Keldeo?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:10.740
﻿Hasn't he become quite strong?

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.950
Will you approve of his fight against Kyurem?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:14.950
﻿No.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.870
Keldeo still cannot use his sword.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:20.920
﻿That's true.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:22.920
﻿When he is able to use a sword...

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.960
Furthermore, when he understands the true weight of that sword...

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.130
Only then can Keldeo become a Sacred Swordsman.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.430
You're pretty cautious, Cobalon.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.050
﻿I heard all that!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.140
﻿What's the weight of a sword supposed to be?

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.300
Well, you see...

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.020
﻿Terrakion

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:38.980
﻿Oops

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.100
﻿Think of that on your own.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.860
﻿Actually, I don't understand very well either.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.280
﻿I'm fighting against Kyurem!

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:50.240
﻿No, you won't

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:52.570
﻿I've been working towards that purpose all this time!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.790
﻿So I can fight against the strongest Pokemon on Earth!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.330
﻿The time still isn't right for that.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.120
﻿I think so as well.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.710
﻿Let's continue training a bit more together.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:31.820
﻿Keldeo's missing.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.240
Could he have gone to where Kyurem is?

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.450
I can fight already!

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:43.830
﻿I will become a Sacred Swordsman!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.630
﻿That's what I've been training for all this time!

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:13.820
﻿Here it is!

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.000
Come out, Kyurem! I am Keldeo!

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.930
I've come to fight. Fight me!

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:32.900
﻿Terrakion...

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:46.240
Do you possess the qualification needed to fight me?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:47.370
Qualification...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:49.210
﻿Well?

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:54.590
﻿I...

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:56.590
...﻿am a Sacred Swordsman!

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.550
﻿A Sacred Swordsman?

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:02.800
Very well.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.550
Pass Through that gate.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.920
﻿Here we go, Kyurem!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.980
﻿The fight has started!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.600
﻿Keldeo has already passed the gate.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.990
﻿Is that all there is to a Sacred Swordsman's strength!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.150
﻿Sacred Swordsman?

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.840
﻿It's too early for this to end.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:45.680
It's not over yet! I... am a Sacred Swordsman!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:46.800
That idiot...

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.600
He must not lie like that.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:49.900
To think that he...

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.140
I can still fight!

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:23.260
He's strong!

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.760
Keldeo is being overcome by fear.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.200
There's no choice now!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.500
This is a formal fight!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:37.690
﻿We can't interfere

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.100
I can't just sit here and watch!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.060
﻿Kyurem!

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:42.480
﻿Please stop it!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:46.900
Don't interfere!

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:47.900
﻿You're wrong!

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.950
He said that you're wrong!

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:09.300
﻿Kyurem just

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.500
Those who interfere with a fight...

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.760
﻿no matter who they are, I won't forgive them!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.300
No way...

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.290
﻿The fight isn't over yet.

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:18.010
tsuppashiru yajirushi hitotsu!

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:18.010
﻿One dashing arrow!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.890
shinayaka na yajirushi hitotsu!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.890
﻿One nimble arrow! ﻿

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.750
kangaeru yajirushi hitotsu!

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.770
﻿One thinking arrow!

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.400
sore ga ima no ore-tachi!

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.400
﻿That’s who we are right now!

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:32.050
midori no yama wo koe masshiro na kumo wo nui

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:32.070
﻿Let’s cross the green mountain, surpass the pure-white clouds,

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:37.790
kouya wo irodori susumou yajirushi ni natte!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:37.790
﻿Color the wasteland and move forward by becoming an arrow! ﻿

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:44.000
totsuzen magatte mitari nejiretari furuetari

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:44.000
﻿Sometimes we suddenly turn, twist or tremble

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:49.250
hanarebanare nio naru koto mo nai wake ja nai!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:49.250
﻿It’s not like we never get separated either!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:55.550
wakeriaenai mama ichinichi ga owaru nante

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:55.550
I can't stand it when the day ends before we

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:03.640
mappira gomen da ze kokoro miseaou!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:03.640
﻿Come to an understanding, let’s show our hearts to each other! ﻿

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.780
iwa yori mo yajirushi tsuyoku!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.780
﻿Arrows stronger than rocks!

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.700
sora yori mo yajirushi takaku!

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.700
﻿Arrows higher up than the sky!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.490
noni yori mo yajirushi yasashiku!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.490
﻿Arrows gentler than anything else!

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:23.200
sou sa itsuka ore-tachi!

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:23.250
﻿That’s right, someday we’ll be!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:28.790
akubi ga dechau you na yuruyuru no gogo mo aru

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:28.790
﻿There are leisurely afternoons that make us yawn

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:34.760
sore demo kakegoe hitotsu de taba ni nareru ze!

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:34.760
﻿But one call will make us form a group!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:40.640
bibitte supiidodaun nante no mo aru keredo

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:40.640
﻿There are times whence get scared and slow down

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:46.060
kigatsukya katte ni kono ashi ga mata hashitteru

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:46.060
﻿But before we know it, our feet are running again!

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:53.440
michi ga mienaku natte tokidoki tohou kureru

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:53.440
﻿I can no longer see the road and sometimes I get lost

00:17:53.480 --> 00:18:00.370
dakedo soba ni wa koitsu ga itekureru!

00:17:53.480 --> 00:18:00.370
﻿But this guy is by my side!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:04.580
﻿qou de soe toki ni wo kumo m

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:06.710
mabushii taiyou de sae toki ni wa kumo ni kakureru

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:06.710
﻿Even the dazzling sun hides behind clouds at times

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:12.330
dakedo deai ga itsdemo hikari wo kureru!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:12.330
﻿But meetings will always bring light!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.670
atsusugiru yajirushi hitotsu!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.670
﻿One too heated arrow!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.630
kisoiau yajirushi futatsu!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.630
﻿Two arrows competing with each other!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.470
tasukeau yajirushi mittsu!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.470
﻿Three arrows helping each other!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.180
dakara kokoro orenai!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.180
﻿That’s why the heart doesn’t break!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.390
sono saki e yajirushi susume!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.390
﻿Arrow, move forward!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.270
ima yori mo yajirushi hikare!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.270
﻿Arrow, shine even more than now!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:33.440
yume ni tsukisasare!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:33.440
﻿Pierce your dream!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:48.250
Continuing his journey to become a Pokemon Master,
Satoshi and the others have arrived at Wind Station.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:55.300
It's just a little further until they reach Roshan,
the next city they're heading towards.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:19:00.880
The train will only stop for three minutes. I'm a Railway
Lunch Sommelier, so please follow my directions.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:07.430
﻿Start!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.810
Daru-darumakka, Darumakka!

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:17.980
It's the Wind Station's special Darumakka Lunch!

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:20.740
﻿When you're done eating, you can use it as a decoration!

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:27.700
It can also be used as a wind chime, allowing one to enjoy the
gentle sounds of the wind. Such a wonderful box lunch.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:28.870
﻿ ﻿You're pretty knowledgeable.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.080
﻿It's because I'm a Railway Lunch Sommelier.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.250
﻿Miss, we'll have those Darumakka Lunches!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:35.880
Thank you. How many?

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:39.260
We'll take fifteen Darumakka Lunches...

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.180
﻿and for dessert, three bags of frozen Oran Berries.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.760
﻿Also, three bottles each of water and tea, please!

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:47.180
﻿My pleasure!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.680
Kaching-kaching-ka, Darumakka!

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:50.680
﻿All right!

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:51.600
﻿Okay!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.140
﻿Okay!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.940
Vanipeti, get out the Oran Berries.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.200
﻿They're frozen Oran Berries!

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:07.910
All aboard for Roshan! We'll be leaving shortly!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:09.790
﻿Let's hurry, everyone!

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:18.250
﻿Oh no!

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:36.900
﻿Gotcha!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.620
Best wishes! Have a safe trip!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:55.750
﻿Goodbye!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:56.710
﻿Miss!

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.250
Best wishes!

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:00.800
Zuruggu!

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:06.470
Zuruggu!

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:11.310
Zuruggu, jump!

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:15.350
Tsutarja, Vine Whip!

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.650
Zuruggu, I'm so sorry!

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.660
What's wrong, Pikachu?

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.930
﻿I've never seen this Pokémon before.

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:48.220
﻿Me neither.

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:49.590
﻿I wonder what happened.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.430
Satoshi! Iris!

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:03.860
﻿He's coming...

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:05.610
﻿Kyurem is coming!

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:07.490
﻿It talked!

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:09.320
﻿I heard it too!

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:10.160
﻿Indeed...

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:11.660
﻿Kyurem is coming!

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:14.370
﻿Ah, watch out!

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.160
﻿Calm down!

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:20.120
﻿It said that Kyurem is coming or something.

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:22.420
I've heard about Kyurem!

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:24.250
Hey, hang in there!

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:31.360
Is... is that Kyurem?

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:38.980
﻿Run!

00:23:04.170 --> 00:23:05.750
﻿Why are you attacking us?

00:23:28.030 --> 00:23:28.480
How is it?

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:30.820
It seems to have been weakened a lot.

00:23:31.400 --> 00:23:32.050
Hang in there!

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:33.910
﻿Well be reaching the city soon!

00:23:39.400 --> 00:23:44.200
i've heard about Kyurem from the old matriarch of the Dragon Village!

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:50.400
Hey, Matriarch?

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:53.930
What is the strongest Dragon Pokémon?

00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:58.350
You might not like it, Iris.

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:01.600
There's no way i could hate a Dragon Pokémon.

00:24:02.600 --> 00:24:07.500
That dragon was born at the same time as Zekrom and Reshiram.

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:10.490
It possesses the strongest genes.

00:24:11.610 --> 00:24:16.240
And its body is constantly emitting a bitter chill.

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:20.200
Eh? So you mean it's extremely cold?

00:24:20.450 --> 00:24:22.160
I don't do well with the cold.

00:24:23.620 --> 00:24:28.210
﻿Kyurem is the strongest Dragon Pokemon on Earth!

00:24:59.160 --> 00:25:01.490
﻿Its horn seems to have been recently broken.

00:25:03.000 --> 00:25:04.290
﻿What happened exactly?

00:25:04.580 --> 00:25:08.040
Who knows? We don't have a clue.

00:25:08.630 --> 00:25:09.420
The one that did this...

00:25:10.000 --> 00:25:11.840
...was probably that Kyurem.

00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:12.710
﻿Huh?

00:25:12.920 --> 00:25:14.010
﻿You encountered Kyurem?

00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:14.840
﻿Yes.

00:25:15.430 --> 00:25:16.430
﻿That's really odd...

00:25:16.930 --> 00:25:19.850
﻿Kyurem lives in an abandoned mine beyond the mountains.

00:25:20.310 --> 00:25:22.220
﻿It's said to rarely leave the place.

00:25:24.020 --> 00:25:26.300
﻿But it suddenly attacked us

00:25:27.190 --> 00:25:29.270
﻿Keldeo was fighting with Kyurem, right?

00:25:30.020 --> 00:25:30.650
"Keldeo"?

00:25:31.730 --> 00:25:33.480
﻿Is that little one named Keldeo?

00:25:33.900 --> 00:25:34.940
﻿You didn't know?

00:25:35.570 --> 00:25:36.530
This is the first time we've ever seen it.

00:25:36.820 --> 00:25:37.410
﻿I see...

00:25:38.160 --> 00:25:39.660
﻿Then, I'll show you something good.

00:25:43.540 --> 00:25:44.330
﻿These are...?

00:25:45.210 --> 00:25:47.170
Pokémon referred to as the Sacred Swordsmen.

00:25:47.710 --> 00:25:48.670
"Sacred Swordsmen"?

00:25:50.170 --> 00:25:53.050
They travel the land, tirelessly training themselves as they go...

00:25:53.840 --> 00:25:56.010
﻿For the sake of protecting Pokémon and the world.

00:25:56.340 --> 00:25:57.220
﻿So cool!

00:25:58.140 --> 00:26:01.260
﻿Unrivaled in terms of raw power and ramming strength: Terrakion.

00:26:02.890 --> 00:26:06.180
﻿Number one when if comes to speed and sense of justice: Virizion.

00:26:07.560 --> 00:26:10.060
﻿And Cobalon, who acts as a leader to the Sacred Swordsmen.

00:26:10.980 --> 00:26:14.070
﻿It possesses a calm composure as well as a heart and body of steel.

00:26:14.690 --> 00:26:15.230
﻿Also...

00:26:16.360 --> 00:26:19.530
Keldeo is a Pokémon that will become their successor.

00:26:20.240 --> 00:26:21.120
﻿Or so it's said.

00:26:22.240 --> 00:26:25.620
Then... Keldeo is an associate of the Sacred Swordsmen?

00:26:26.000 --> 00:26:26.700
﻿That's right!

00:26:27.750 --> 00:26:28.750
﻿Amazing!

00:26:33.050 --> 00:26:35.130
﻿I'm so glad you're feeling better!

00:26:36.840 --> 00:26:37.760
﻿I'm Satoshi.

00:26:38.340 --> 00:26:39.930
﻿This is my partner Pikachu.

00:26:41.550 --> 00:26:42.720
﻿I'm Iris'

00:26:43.140 --> 00:26:43.970
﻿This little one is Kibago!

00:26:44.800 --> 00:26:46.100
I'm Dent!

00:26:46.890 --> 00:26:49.140
Keldeo, what exactly happened?

00:27:00.660 --> 00:27:02.410
I challenged it to a fight...

00:27:03.080 --> 00:27:03.700
﻿Kyurem?

00:27:05.330 --> 00:27:06.830
I want to become a Sacred Swordsman...

00:27:07.370 --> 00:27:11.420
Do you have to fight with Kyurem in order
to become a sacred Swordsman?

00:27:13.920 --> 00:27:14.710
I see.

00:27:19.840 --> 00:27:21.180
﻿Night Slash!

00:27:21.430 --> 00:27:22.430
﻿Wild Charge!

00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:25.750
﻿But...

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:30.520
During the fight... I got frightened.

00:27:32.850 --> 00:27:38.570
And Kyurem entrapped the Sacred Swordsmen
in ice when they tried to save me.

00:27:46.290 --> 00:27:48.790
I... ran away!

00:27:49.870 --> 00:27:51.460
Then... the Sacred Swordsmen...

00:27:54.040 --> 00:27:55.460
They're still frozen!

00:28:00.550 --> 00:28:04.260
﻿I'm sure Kyurem won't forgive me for running away.

00:28:05.100 --> 00:28:06.430
So that's why it attacked you?

00:28:10.480 --> 00:28:11.140
﻿Keldeo!

00:28:11.600 --> 00:28:12.730
﻿Are you scared'?

00:28:13.100 --> 00:28:13.560
﻿What?

00:28:14.690 --> 00:28:17.150
﻿Getting scared just because you were defeated once...

00:28:17.360 --> 00:28:18.820
﻿You won't become a Sacred Swordsman like that!

00:28:18.980 --> 00:28:20.360
﻿Who's scared?

00:28:21.650 --> 00:28:24.660
I'm going to go save the Sacred Swordsmen right now!

00:28:28.040 --> 00:28:29.160
Now that's the spirit!

00:28:31.580 --> 00:28:33.080
﻿We'll help you out too!

00:28:34.250 --> 00:28:34.960
﻿Me too!

00:28:35.130 --> 00:28:35.670
﻿I will too!

00:28:36.130 --> 00:28:36.830
﻿Well go together!

00:28:39.050 --> 00:28:40.960
Satoshi... Everyone.

00:28:44.430 --> 00:28:45.130
﻿All right!

00:28:46.760 --> 00:28:47.760
Wait a minute!

00:28:48.970 --> 00:28:49.850
Before that...

00:28:53.270 --> 00:28:54.690
﻿It's railway lunch time!

00:28:55.500 --> 00:28:58.400
They say you can't battle if you're hungry, right?

00:28:59.360 --> 00:29:01.530
﻿Daru-darumakka, Darumakka Lunch!

00:29:01.570 --> 00:29:02.780
Let's eat!

00:29:03.150 --> 00:29:04.360
﻿Let's eat!

00:29:05.360 --> 00:29:06.820
Keldeo, don't be shy.

00:29:09.950 --> 00:29:14.710
Such a sweet aroma! Additionally, this is both
juicy and perfectly crunchy at the same time!

00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:15.460
﻿This is...

00:29:16.210 --> 00:29:21.000
A boxed lunch is truly good if it's still tasty even after some time has passed. ﻿

00:29:16.210 --> 00:29:16.790
Delicious.

00:29:17.130 --> 00:29:17.830
Right?

00:29:23.340 --> 00:29:26.340
﻿What are you doing? Such a child!

00:29:26.590 --> 00:29:28.090
Water, water!

00:29:26.590 --> 00:29:29.000
No need to rush, there's still plenty!

00:30:14.930 --> 00:30:17.020
﻿This is White Kyurem.

00:30:18.560 --> 00:30:21.360
﻿﻿And this is Black Kyurem.

00:30:22.070 --> 00:30:23.070
﻿They look strong!

00:30:24.690 --> 00:30:33.080
Kyurem is capable of changing its form and using
the powers of both Reshiram and Zekrom.

00:30:34.700 --> 00:30:35.240
﻿That's why...

00:30:36.250 --> 00:30:38.330
...Kyurem is the strongest on Earth.

00:30:39.540 --> 00:30:41.500
﻿Using Reshiram and Zekrom's power...

00:30:49.550 --> 00:30:52.140
What's going on? I can't stand the cold!

00:30:56.060 --> 00:30:56.640
﻿They're Freegeo!

00:30:57.100 --> 00:30:58.770
﻿Be careful! They're Kyurem's allies!

00:31:03.610 --> 00:31:05.230
﻿Hey, what are you doing all of a sudden?

00:31:05.530 --> 00:31:06.780
﻿Satoshi and the others have nothing to do with this!

00:31:08.900 --> 00:31:10.030
﻿Satoshi, this way!

00:31:22.960 --> 00:31:23.830
White Kyurem!

00:31:23.840 --> 00:31:24.290
﻿You mean that!

00:31:35.930 --> 00:31:37.390
﻿Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:31:45.820 --> 00:31:46.650
﻿It changed again!

00:31:46.900 --> 00:31:48.280
This is Black Kyurem!

00:32:20.100 --> 00:32:21.520
﻿Satoshi, where are you going?

00:32:25.020 --> 00:32:26.440
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

00:32:30.990 --> 00:32:32.070
﻿Thank you, Pikachu!

00:32:32.530 --> 00:32:33.070
﻿Satoshi!

00:32:44.370 --> 00:32:45.290
﻿Good job, Keldeo!

00:32:46.250 --> 00:32:47.790
Pikachu, Electro Ball!

00:33:02.600 --> 00:33:03.930
Satoshi, Pikachu, grab on!

00:33:40.100 --> 00:33:40.550
﻿Thank you!

00:33:41.470 --> 00:33:41.930
﻿Let's go!

00:33:50.230 --> 00:33:51.940
Satoshi, over here!

00:34:15.670 --> 00:34:16.880
﻿Gantle, I choose you!

00:34:27.850 --> 00:34:28.390
﻿Keldeo!

00:34:29.350 --> 00:34:31.020
﻿Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:34:43.200 --> 00:34:44.950
Satoshi! Over here!

00:34:47.410 --> 00:34:48.200
﻿Return, Gantle!

00:34:52.630 --> 00:34:54.170
﻿How will we get out of the city?

00:34:54.920 --> 00:34:59.340
This city's subway system was designed to let you
go wherever you want no matter where you are.

00:34:59.880 --> 00:35:01.180
﻿So we're leaving by subway?

00:35:02.300 --> 00:35:07.020
The plan was to leave the city along some unused tracks, but...

00:35:09.100 --> 00:35:10.480
...﻿it's locked

00:35:11.900 --> 00:35:12.730
﻿Can I try?

00:35:17.570 --> 00:35:18.530
Will that do?

00:35:41.970 --> 00:35:43.340
I'm getting kinda hungry. Aren't you?

00:35:44.970 --> 00:35:46.720
Didn't you just eat?

00:35:47.200 --> 00:35:48.050
Such a child.

00:35:48.180 --> 00:35:49.980
Huh? You're out of boxed lunches?

00:35:50.390 --> 00:35:51.230
﻿You too?

00:35:53.770 --> 00:35:54.360
﻿We're here!

00:35:57.030 --> 00:35:58.190
﻿Another door?

00:35:59.230 --> 00:36:00.240
﻿Just leave it to me!

00:36:01.050 --> 00:36:01.800
Wait a minute!

00:36:05.370 --> 00:36:07.160
There, it was already unlocked.

00:36:14.170 --> 00:36:17.800
This former station has been turned into a museum for vehicles!

00:36:18.100 --> 00:36:19.000
Wow!

00:36:20.210 --> 00:36:22.680
Once we exit this place, we'll be outside the city!

00:36:28.430 --> 00:36:28.720
I just had a great idea!

00:36:31.600 --> 00:36:32.060
﻿Look.

00:36:32.730 --> 00:36:33.850
﻿Doesn't it seem like it could still be used?

00:37:04.430 --> 00:37:05.800
﻿Kibago, don't you worry!

00:37:06.140 --> 00:37:06.890
We'll be just fine!

00:37:21.230 --> 00:37:22.610
I wonder if she'll be all right alone.

00:37:23.750 --> 00:37:24.850
We'll have to trust Iris.

00:37:25.280 --> 00:37:25.650
﻿Yeah

00:37:27.850 --> 00:37:29.100
I'll serve as a decoy...

00:37:29.600 --> 00:37:33.000
In the meantime, you go save your friends.

00:37:33.500 --> 00:37:34.200
﻿Good luck!

00:37:37.750 --> 00:37:38.460
Iris.

00:37:45.400 --> 00:37:46.700
Too bad!

00:37:47.100 --> 00:37:50.100
Kibago and I are the only ones in here!

00:39:02.290 --> 00:39:04.170
Okay, it'll keep running as long as there's power.

00:39:04.800 --> 00:39:06.400
I'll draw the Freegeo away!

00:39:07.460 --> 00:39:10.010
﻿Keldeo. save the Sacred Swordsmen!

00:39:13.560 --> 00:39:14.050
﻿Dent...

00:39:21.400 --> 00:39:22.400
﻿This way!

00:39:22.900 --> 00:39:24.570
﻿Muggyo, give me some juice.

00:39:43.540 --> 00:39:44.750
﻿Two is more than one.

00:39:47.710 --> 00:39:49.090
﻿Three is more than two.

00:39:51.970 --> 00:39:53.930
﻿When comrades make their powers become one...

00:39:54.800 --> 00:39:57.510
...﻿true strength and genuine courage will be born!

00:40:03.400 --> 00:40:06.190
True strength... and genuine courage...

00:40:07.480 --> 00:40:07.820
Hey, Keldeo.

00:40:09.500 --> 00:40:12.000
What kind of Pokémon are the Sacred Swordsmen?

00:40:15.070 --> 00:40:17.580
﻿Terrakion has more power than anybody.

00:40:19.950 --> 00:40:21.120
﻿Listen, Keldeo.

00:40:21.830 --> 00:40:25.040
When you're in battle, never take your eyes off your opponent.

00:40:25.590 --> 00:40:27.340
﻿Concentrate. Just concentrate.

00:40:46.060 --> 00:40:48.400
﻿He's very funny and kind.

00:40:49.280 --> 00:40:51.070
Heh, so he's a great guy.

00:40:52.450 --> 00:40:53.300
And Virizion?

00:40:53.820 --> 00:40:57.280
﻿Virizion's awesome, always keeping her cool.

00:41:10.880 --> 00:41:13.010
﻿Your worst enemy is fear.

00:41:13.510 --> 00:41:15.720
﻿You must drive out the anxiety from within you.

00:41:20.680 --> 00:41:21.390
﻿Virizion!

00:41:29.520 --> 00:41:32.610
﻿If you rid yourself of fear, you can become free!

00:41:34.450 --> 00:41:37.860
﻿Amongst the Sacred Swordsmen, she's the smartest and the fastest.

00:41:38.830 --> 00:41:39.660
﻿What about Cobalon?

00:41:40.830 --> 00:41:42.910
Cobalon is the leader of the Sacred Swordsmen, right?

00:41:44.210 --> 00:41:44.580
﻿Yeah.

00:41:45.200 --> 00:41:47.100
He's always motivating us and making us improve ourselves.

00:42:02.970 --> 00:42:04.060
﻿Not yet!

00:42:08.440 --> 00:42:13.480
It is all right to lose a battle. Whatever you learn
from that defeat will be true knowledge.

00:42:15.110 --> 00:42:15.690
But...

00:42:16.990 --> 00:42:18.700
﻿You are still in training, Keldeo.

00:42:19.570 --> 00:42:21.160
﻿Until you know the weight of a sword.

00:42:22.200 --> 00:42:25.000
﻿Though sometimes, he speaks in riddles.

00:42:27.670 --> 00:42:28.120
I see.

00:42:33.050 --> 00:42:36.970
Keldeo, it would be nice if you became a Sacred Swordsman soon.

00:43:02.160 --> 00:43:03.580
﻿Iwapalace, come out!

00:43:06.950 --> 00:43:08.540
﻿Iwapalace, Rock Wrecker!

00:43:20.550 --> 00:43:21.930
﻿Fire the Rock Wrecker!

00:43:26.390 --> 00:43:27.390
﻿Good job, Iwapalace! ﻿

00:43:51.870 --> 00:43:52.920
﻿Too bad!

00:43:53.080 --> 00:43:54.330
﻿It's just us here!

00:44:09.140 --> 00:44:09.640
﻿Satoshi!

00:44:22.030 --> 00:44:24.240
Why go this far?

00:44:25.910 --> 00:44:27.280
﻿You just met me.

00:44:28.200 --> 00:44:29.750
What are you saying?

00:44:30.500 --> 00:44:32.380
﻿Aren't we friends'*

00:44:33.790 --> 00:44:34.500
﻿Friends?

00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:39.000
Besides, you're pretty interesting.

00:44:57.610 --> 00:44:58.270
﻿That must be it.

00:45:40.690 --> 00:45:41.780
﻿Nothing but to go over.

00:45:52.700 --> 00:45:53.330
﻿Keldeo?

00:45:54.000 --> 00:45:55.700
﻿I...I...

00:45:59.500 --> 00:46:02.800
I told Kyurem that i was a Sacred Swordsman...

00:46:03.420 --> 00:46:05.590
I began the fight with a lie!

00:46:09.760 --> 00:46:12.680
That's why i know Kyurem won't forgive me.

00:46:21.070 --> 00:46:21.770
﻿I get it!

00:46:25.030 --> 00:46:26.150
We'll go ahead!

00:46:26.740 --> 00:46:27.950
﻿Pikachu, let's go!

00:46:57.770 --> 00:46:58.770
﻿Hey!

00:46:59.710 --> 00:47:00.610
﻿Hey!

00:47:19.620 --> 00:47:21.960
Where are the Sacred Swordsmen?

00:47:34.810 --> 00:47:35.260
﻿Over there?

00:47:49.570 --> 00:47:50.400
No doubt about it!

00:47:51.110 --> 00:47:51.990
﻿They're the Sacred Swordsmen!

00:47:54.850 --> 00:47:55.850
I'll save you right now!

00:48:01.920 --> 00:48:03.380
﻿Chaoboo, Flamethrower!

00:48:03.710 --> 00:48:05.130
Gantle, Rock Smash!

00:48:13.180 --> 00:48:14.720
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

00:48:20.100 --> 00:48:21.980
Okay everyone, keep going!

00:48:55.920 --> 00:48:58.240
This is not a place for humans!

00:48:59.200 --> 00:49:00.140
Get out!

00:49:01.700 --> 00:49:04.100
There's something we have to do!

00:49:40.640 --> 00:49:41.310
﻿Keldeo!

00:49:42.480 --> 00:49:43.560
I knew it!

00:49:45.230 --> 00:49:46.640
I knew you'd come!

00:49:49.610 --> 00:49:51.150
﻿Satoshi, Pikachu...

00:50:02.240 --> 00:50:02.830
﻿Kyurem!

00:50:05.290 --> 00:50:06.500
﻿I lied!

00:50:07.250 --> 00:50:08.800
I'm not a Sacred Swordsman yet!

00:50:10.090 --> 00:50:12.000
﻿I'm just an apprentice swordsman.

00:50:14.880 --> 00:50:17.510
I might not have the qualification to fight you.

00:50:18.500 --> 00:50:20.700
But i still wanted to fight.

00:50:21.250 --> 00:50:23.850
I wanted to fight you no matter what!

00:50:27.560 --> 00:50:29.770
﻿Did you think I wouldn't know that?

00:50:49.290 --> 00:50:50.210
﻿You may pass the gate once more.

00:50:52.630 --> 00:50:53.880
Let's settle this.

00:50:59.010 --> 00:50:59.720
﻿Keldeo!

00:51:00.640 --> 00:51:01.800
Strengthen your resolve!

00:51:02.260 --> 00:51:04.220
Aren't you going to become a Sacred Swordsman?

00:51:04.850 --> 00:51:05.680
﻿Satoshi!

00:51:21.800 --> 00:51:22.550
That's right!

00:51:26.040 --> 00:51:28.330
﻿That's right, I was never alone.

00:51:30.460 --> 00:51:31.580
Everyone was there for me the whole time!

00:51:34.880 --> 00:51:36.340
They've raised me!

00:51:39.720 --> 00:51:42.470
﻿I can no longer run away!

00:51:47.180 --> 00:51:49.560
﻿I will become a Sacred Swordsman!

00:52:06.290 --> 00:52:09.540
﻿Keldeo's form... it changed!

00:52:09.910 --> 00:52:10.330
﻿Yeah

00:52:10.830 --> 00:52:12.080
﻿Iris! Dent!

00:52:12.750 --> 00:52:13.920
﻿Here I come, Kyurem!

00:52:15.400 --> 00:52:16.150
Come at me!

00:53:02.680 --> 00:53:03.680
Way to go, Keldeo!

00:53:18.730 --> 00:53:19.730
You can't defeat me with a sword like that!

00:53:25.990 --> 00:53:26.610
﻿Keldeo!

00:53:44.750 --> 00:53:45.800
﻿Keldeo!

00:54:05.400 --> 00:54:06.070
Is this it?

00:54:24.760 --> 00:54:25.260
﻿Kyurem!

00:54:25.760 --> 00:54:26.510
﻿Stop it already!

00:54:30.680 --> 00:54:32.310
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:54:43.940 --> 00:54:45.860
The match is not...

00:54:47.610 --> 00:54:49.450
...over yet!

00:55:38.460 --> 00:55:39.290
﻿The Sacred Swordsmen!

00:55:41.920 --> 00:55:43.630
﻿Satoshi, I thank you.

00:55:44.090 --> 00:55:45.130
﻿How do you know my name?

00:55:46.000 --> 00:55:47.630
﻿We could hear even inside the ice.

00:55:48.010 --> 00:55:50.420
Thanks for saving Keldeo.

00:55:56.970 --> 00:55:58.720
Chaoboo, Gantle, thank you.

00:56:18.250 --> 00:56:18.790
﻿Keldeo...

00:56:19.620 --> 00:56:20.910
﻿Isn't he overdoing it?

00:56:21.120 --> 00:56:21.540
﻿Yeah.

00:56:22.420 --> 00:56:23.290
Stop them!

00:56:24.080 --> 00:56:26.040
﻿This is Keldeo's fight.

00:56:26.590 --> 00:56:28.420
﻿The only one who can end it's him.

00:56:41.440 --> 00:56:42.890
﻿Don't take your eyes off your opponent.

00:56:43.900 --> 00:56:46.060
﻿Concentrate until the very end.

00:56:48.900 --> 00:56:51.190
Your greatest enemy is fear.

00:56:52.910 --> 00:56:53.820
﻿You must drive out the anxiety from within you.

00:57:06.170 --> 00:57:09.960
﻿Whatever you learn from defeat is of great importance.

00:57:18.470 --> 00:57:19.100
﻿Keldeo!

00:57:55.750 --> 00:57:57.590
He's really doing it!

00:57:58.140 --> 00:58:00.300
All that remains is whether he can use the sword or not.

00:58:01.560 --> 00:58:02.970
Way to go, Keldeo!

00:58:04.100 --> 00:58:05.350
Satoshi! Pikachu!

00:59:13.800 --> 00:59:14.300
﻿Is that...

00:59:15.130 --> 00:59:16.260
﻿Secret Sword!

00:59:22.260 --> 00:59:24.310
I can still fight!

00:59:24.770 --> 00:59:26.140
﻿All right, Keldeo!

00:59:44.700 --> 00:59:45.660
﻿Amazing!

00:59:46.660 --> 00:59:48.750
Such a powerful taste!

00:59:49.100 --> 00:59:50.000
He can do this!

01:00:01.380 --> 01:00:02.130
﻿He blocked it!

01:00:16.440 --> 01:00:20.240
﻿I've been wailing for this. This is your true power. ﻿

01:00:29.910 --> 01:00:33.670
It's when you bring out your true power that the real fight starts.

01:01:59.500 --> 01:02:00.040
﻿It's

01:02:00.920 --> 01:02:01.750
﻿...my loss.

01:02:17.100 --> 01:02:23.400
﻿You chose to protect your friends over the match.

01:02:27.750 --> 01:02:29.500
That's a fine sword.

01:02:31.200 --> 01:02:31.780
﻿Kyurem...

01:02:50.720 --> 01:02:51.430
﻿Keldeo!

01:02:52.510 --> 01:02:54.310
﻿You showed me a great battle!

01:02:55.930 --> 01:02:57.810
﻿Thank goodness, your horn is fixed too.

01:02:59.270 --> 01:03:01.610
﻿Now you understand what is meant by the weight of a sword.

01:03:09.030 --> 01:03:09.410
﻿Yes.

01:03:25.760 --> 01:03:26.460
﻿Everyone, get on!

01:03:40.150 --> 01:03:40.690
﻿Pikachu!

01:03:44.770 --> 01:03:45.520
I'm going on ahead!

01:04:20.730 --> 01:04:22.310
It's like an ice castle.

01:04:23.480 --> 01:04:25.020
It seems a tad cold, though.

01:04:25.110 --> 01:04:26.570
I've had enough of being cold. ﻿

01:04:48.750 --> 01:04:49.300
Keldeo...

01:04:50.090 --> 01:04:51.880
﻿You're now a fine Sacred Swordsman.

01:04:52.380 --> 01:04:53.550
No objections.

01:04:54.260 --> 01:04:55.590
﻿Let's work hard together.

01:04:56.100 --> 01:04:56.430
﻿Let's.

01:04:57.310 --> 01:04:58.510
﻿You did it, Keldeo!

01:05:01.560 --> 01:05:02.270
﻿That's great.

01:05:02.310 --> 01:05:03.850
﻿Good for you. Congratulations!

01:05:04.520 --> 01:05:05.440
﻿Thank you.

01:05:05.770 --> 01:05:06.940
﻿It's thanks to all of you.

01:05:07.650 --> 01:05:09.480
﻿Now we will take the Sacred Swordsmen's oath.

01:05:10.570 --> 01:05:12.280
Satoshi and friends, I'd like you to stand as witnesses.

01:05:12.950 --> 01:05:13.610
﻿Of course!

01:05:22.290 --> 01:05:23.210
﻿He changed again!

01:05:24.460 --> 01:05:26.670
﻿It's Keldeo's Resolute Form.

01:05:57.990 --> 01:05:59.370
﻿Two is more than one.

01:06:00.290 --> 01:06:01.790
﻿Three is more than two.

01:06:02.660 --> 01:06:04.410
﻿Four is more than three.

01:06:05.170 --> 01:06:07.580
﻿When comrades make their powers become one...

01:06:08.790 --> 01:06:12.250
...true strength and genuine courage will be born!

01:06:55.300 --> 01:06:58.510
Tsunaideta te no hira wo

01:06:55.590 --> 01:06:58.510
﻿Even if I raise the hand I held yours with

01:06:58.640 --> 01:07:03.930
Yozora e nobashite mo kimi ni wa

01:06:58.640 --> 01:07:03.930
﻿And stretch its palm toward the night sky

01:07:05.680 --> 01:07:09.020
Furerarenai ne ﻿ ﻿

01:07:05.680 --> 01:07:09.020
﻿I can’t touch you

01:07:10.360 --> 01:07:13.190
Sabishisa ni somerareta

01:07:10.360 --> 01:07:13.190
﻿I want to say goodbye to yesterdays

01:07:13.690 --> 01:07:18.820
Kinou ni wa mou sayonara shitai yo...

01:07:13.690 --> 01:07:18.820
﻿That are tinged with loneliness...

01:07:20.780 --> 01:07:23.990
Wanna stand by myself ﻿

01:07:20.780 --> 01:07:23.990
﻿Wanna stand by myself

01:07:25.040 --> 01:07:31.290
Nobiteku kage ni Say bye-bye

01:07:25.040 --> 01:07:31.290
﻿To the growing shadows, Say bye-bye

01:07:31.790 --> 01:07:33.300
﻿Believe our way ﻿

01:07:32.130 --> 01:07:33.300
﻿Believe our way

01:07:33.750 --> 01:07:37.630
Hanarebanare

01:07:33.750 --> 01:07:37.630
﻿We’re apart,

